    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d192-f1" n="1" xml:id="d192-f1-content">
                <p>Secretary Dulles had met with Stassen, Ohly, and Nolting at 6 p.m. on Dec. 18.
                    The notation concerning this meeting is in Princeton University, Dulles papers,
                    “Dulles’ Appointment Book”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
